      "config_help_hp_boost_offset": "How many °C above the user setpoint SEM lifts the climate target when surplus is available.",
      "config_help_hp_climate": "For climate-only setups (Nibe, Mitsubishi, Daikin): SEM raises the setpoint by boost-offset °C when surplus is available.",
      "config_help_hp_energy_sensor": "A cumulative energy counter (kWh) for the heat pump when it has no power sensor. SEM derives live power from it (or autodetects a power sensor first).",
      "config_help_hp_invert_sg_ready": "Aktivér ved normalt lukket (NC) relæledning — inverterer SG-Ready-kontaktlogikken.",
      "config_help_hp_max_setpoint": "Absolute ceiling for the climate setpoint — SEM won't push past this even with abundant surplus.",
      "config_help_hp_power_sensor": "Optional — lets SEM include heat-pump draw in load tracking and savings.",
      "config_help_hp_priority": "Lower = higher priority. EV usually gets 1-3; heat pump 4-6; pool 7-10.",
      "config_help_hp_rated_power": "The heat pump's rated electrical draw in watts, used for surplus sizing when there's no power sensor to calibrate from. Default 2000 W.",
      "config_help_hp_relay": "For SG-Ready setups: both relays must be set. Skip if your heat pump only exposes a climate entity.",
      "config_help_hp_temperature_sensor": "Sensoren SEM læser for varmepumpe-/buffertemperaturen.",
      "config_help_hw_energy_sensor": "A cumulative energy counter (kWh) for the hot water device when it has no power sensor. SEM derives live power from it (or autodetects a power sensor first).",
      "config_help_hw_entity": "A switch or water_heater entity SEM can toggle on/off to drive the boiler. Required.",
      "config_help_hw_legionella_target": "Target temperature for the periodic Legionella sterilisation cycle. Typically 60–65 °C.",
      "config_help_hw_max_temperature": "Hardware safety ceiling. SEM never activates above this regardless of mode.",
      "config_help_hw_min_temperature": "Below this, SEM force-heats from any source (not just solar) to ensure usable hot water.",
      "config_help_hw_power_sensor": "Optional — lets SEM include heat-pump draw in load tracking and savings.",
      "config_help_hw_priority": "Surplus-dispatch priority. Lower numbers are served first. 1 = highest priority.",
      "config_help_hw_rated_power": "The hot water device's rated electrical draw in watts, used for surplus sizing when there's no power sensor to calibrate from. Default 2500 W.",
      "config_help_hw_solar_target": "Solar-boost cutoff temperature. SEM stops activating the boiler on surplus when the water reaches this.",
      "config_help_hw_temp_sensor": "Optional. When configured, SEM blocks heating once the temperature reaches the active target. Leave empty to trust the boiler's internal thermostat only.",
      "config_help_import_rate": "Per-kWh price you pay when importing on the high-tariff side.",
      "config_help_label": "Forklar indstillinger",
      "config_help_lm_critical_protection": "When on, devices marked critical are never shed (e.g. dialysis, server rack).",
      "config_help_lm_emergency_peak": "Hard kW ceiling. SEM forces every sheddable device off at this level.",
      "config_help_lm_enabled": "When on, SEM sheds non-critical loads to keep grid draw under the target peak.",
      "config_help_lm_target_peak": "Grid kW you want to stay under. SEM treats this as the soft ceiling.",
      "config_help_lm_unlimited": "Slår spidsbelastningsstyring helt fra – SEM dimensionerer ikke længere forbrug efter grænsen og kobler aldrig fra for at overholde den. Kun til tilslutninger, som ingen husholdningsbelastning kan true. Til forskel fra kontakten ovenfor, som kun stopper frakoblingen, men beholder grænsen som dimensioneringsloft.",
      "config_help_lm_warning_peak": "kW at which SEM starts asking sheddable devices to reduce.",
      "config_help_min_solar_power": "Below this solar output (W), SEM stops surplus charging — even tiny PV is below the noise floor.",
      "config_help_notif_charger": "Push notifications for individual chargers (start, stop, target reached, etc.).",
      "config_help_notif_mobile": "Master switch — when off, SEM never sends mobile notifications regardless of service config.",
      "config_help_notif_service": "Which mobile_app service receives push notifications. Pick the device you want to be paged on.",
      "config_help_observer_mode": "Read-only mode: SEM watches your system but sends no commands. Safe to enable while learning the system.",
      "config_help_off_peak_rate": "Per-kWh price during the off-peak window (NT).",
      "config_help_regulation_offset": "En lille effektbuffer, der holdes som eksport, så SEM ikke risikerer at importere, mens overskudsopladning reguleres. Det målte overskud reduceres med dette beløb, før det tilbydes enheder. Standard 50 W.",
      "config_help_solar_production_sensor": "Live solar power (W). Set this if your Energy Dashboard has only a solar energy (kWh) sensor, so Home consumption isn't stuck at 0. SEM tries to autodetect it first.",
      "config_help_strategy_entity": "The select entity that sets the battery's power strategy (e.g. select.sessy_*_power_strategy). SEM switches it to the API/active value while it drives the setpoint and restores your normal mode (nom/roi/eco) afterward. Needed for AC-coupled batteries like Sessy; leave empty otherwise.",
      "config_help_tariff_class_mode": "Percentile adapts to your tariff's actual range; static uses your cheap/expensive thresholds verbatim.",
      "config_help_tariff_mode": "Static = one fixed price. Dynamic = pulls hourly prices from your tariff sensor. Calendar = scheduled HT/NT windows.",
      "config_help_update_interval": "Seconds between coordinator cycles. Lower = more responsive, higher = lighter on HA. 30 s is the sweet spot.",
      "config_help_vacation_entity": "Valgfrit eksternt feriesignal (varmepumpens ferietilstand, input_boolean eller kalender). Så længe det er aktivt, undertrykker SEM komfortopvarmning.",
      "config_help_vpp_enabled": "Reagerer på netoperatørens hændelser (VPP), f.eks. Axle Energy: eksporterer batterieffekt eller pauser/booster EV-opladning i hændelsesvinduet. Starter i observatørtilstand — se docs/GRID_VPP.md for tilslutning og sikkerhedsværn.",
      "config_help_vpp_observer": "Tørkørsel: SEM logger og notificerer, hvad det VILLE gøre under en VPP-hændelse, men styrer intet. Slå først fra, når loggen ser rigtig ud.",
      "config_help_vpp_reserve_soc": "Eksporthændelser aflader aldrig hjemmebatteriet under dette niveau.",
