      "config_help_bs_block_mode": "Pick the cheapest contiguous price window instead of scattered cheapest slots — slightly higher cost, less inverter start/stop cycling.",
      "config_help_bs_capacity": "Usable battery capacity in kWh — used to size pre-charge targets.",
